Title: TSM AppHelper loads without TradeSkillMaster
Why: AppHelper declares a hard dependency on TSM, so without TSM its AppData.lua (the desktop app's price data) never loads. As optional deps it loads either way, after TSM or Meionomics, whichever defines TSM_APPHELPER_LOAD_DATA first.

=== FILE TradeSkillMaster_AppHelper\TradeSkillMaster_AppHelper.toc
--- OLD
## Dependency: TradeSkillMaster
--- NEW
# LOCAL FIX: optional, so Meionomics gets the price data without TSM installed
## OptionalDeps: TradeSkillMaster, Meionomics
=== END
